  "cited_article_id": "post-payments-and-remittances",
  "reply": "To correct the mis‑applied insurance payments, go to **Billing > Ledger History**, find the transaction and click **Reverse Allocation**. Then return to **Billing > Payment Processing**, open the **Unposted Remittances** batch, and use **Match Invoices** (or manually enter amounts) to re‑apply the funds to the correct invoice lines. Ensure the adjustments do not exceed the original line balances and that the billing period is still open."
}
